hookId\": \"02734fda-29c5-4225-89f3-7df481136716\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"76381f6a-c728-47ad-b2f5-36cb589a34da\",\n      \"name\": \"Verify Token\",\n      \"type\": \"n8n-nodes-base.if\",\n      \"typeVersion\": 2,\n      \"position\": [\n        460,\n        300\n      ],\n      \"parameters\": {\n        \"conditions\": {\n          \"options\": {\n            \"leftValue\": \"={{ $request.headers['x-gitlab-token'] }}\",\n            \"operation\": \"equals\",\n            \"rightValue\": \"={{ $env.GITLAB_WEBHOOK_SECRET }}\"\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"3ff27062-0971-4209-b2de-9956be6a0348\",\n      \"name\": \"Is merge_request?\",\n      \"type\": \"n8n-nodes-base.if\",\n      \"typeVersion\": 2,\n      \"position\": [\n        680,\n        260\n      ],\n      \"parameters\": {\n        \"conditions\": {\n          \"options\": {\n            \"leftValue\": \"={{ $json.body.object_kind }}\",\n            \"operation\": \"equals\",\n            \"rightValue\": \"merge_request\"\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"bf887a71-2a7c-4b8d-b8c0-8e348e2fc1d1\",\n      \"name\": \"→ F-09 CI Pipeline\",\n      \"type\": \"n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest\",\n      \"typeVersion\": 4.2,\n      \"position\": [\n        900,\n        460\n      ],\n      \"parameters\": {\n        \"method\": \"POST\",\n        \"url\": \"={{ $env.N8N_WEBHOOK_BASE }}/gitlab-pipeline\",\n        \"sendBody\": true,\n        \"contentType\": \"json\",\n        \"specifyBody\": \"json\",\n        \"jsonBody\": \"={{ $json.body }}\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"b00mr0001-0000-0000-0000-000000000001\",\n      \"name\": \"MR action = open?\",\n      \"type\": \"n8n-nodes-base.if\",\n      \"typeVersion\": 2,\n      \"position\": [\n        900,\n        200\n      ],\n      \"parameters\": {\n        \"conditions\": {\n          \"options\": {\n            \"leftValue\": \"={{ $json.body.object_attributes.action }}\",\n            \"operation\": \"equals\",\n            \"rightValue\": \"open\"\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"b00mr0001-0000-0000-0000-000000000002\",\n      \"name\": \"Open: task/ prefix?\",\n      \"type\": \"n8n-nodes-base.if\",\n      \"typeVersion\": 2,\n      \"position\": [\n        1120,\n        140\n      ],\n      \"parameters\": {\n        \"conditions\": {\n          \"conditions\": [\n            {\n              \"leftValue\": \"={{ $json.body.object_attributes.source_branch }}\",\n              \"rightValue\": \"task/\",\n              \"operator\": {\n                \"type\": \"string\",\n                \"operation\": \"startsWith\"\n              }\n            }\n          ],\n          \"combinator\": \"and\"\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"a87bc4a2-87f4-4982-9594-d03eb4bb5f28\",\n      \"name\": \"→ F-04 Task MR Opened\",\n      \"type\": \"n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest\",\n      \"typeVersion\": 4.2,\n      \"position\": [\n        1340,\n        100\n      ],\n      \"parameters\": {\n        \"method\": \"POST\",\n        \"url\": \"={{ $env.N8N_WEBHOOK_BASE }}/gitlab-task-mr-opened\",\n        \"sendBody\": true,\n        \"contentType\": \"json\",\n        \"specifyBody\": \"json\",\n        \"jsonBody\": \"={{ $json.body }}\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"b00mr0001-0000-0000-0000-000000000003\",\n      \"name\": \"Open: us/ prefix?\",\n      \"type\": \"n8n-nodes-base.if\",\n      \"typeVersion\": 2,\n      \"position\": [\n        1340,\n        220\n      ],\n      \"parameters\": {\n        \"conditions\": {\n          \"conditions\": [\n            {\n              \"leftValue\": \"={{ $json.body.object_attributes.source_branch }}\",\n              \"rightValue\": \"story/\",\n              \"operator\": {\n                \"type\": \"string\",\n                \"operation\": \"startsWith\"\n              }\n            }\n          ],\n          \"combinator\": \"and\"\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"fdd65090-3cbd-41ee-9f7d-7d5b54d135de\",\n      \"name\": \"→ F-07 Story MR Opened\",\n      \"type\": \"n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest\",\n      \"typeVersion\": 4.2,\n      \"position\": [\n        1560,\n        220\n      ],\n      \"parameters\": {\n        \"method\": \"POST\",\n        \"url\": \"={{ $env.N8N_WEBHOOK_BASE }}/story-mr-open\",\n        \"sendBody\": true,\n        \"contentType\": \"json\",\n        \"specifyBody\": \"json\",\n        \"jsonBody\": \"={{ $json.body }}\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"b00mr0002-0000-0000-0000-000000000001\",\n      \"name\": \"Merge: task/ prefix?\",\n      \"type\": \"n8n-nodes-base.if\",\n      \"typeVersion\": 2,\n      \"position\": [\n        1120,\n        400\n      ],\n      \"parameters\": {\n        \"conditions\": {\n          \"conditions\": [\n            {\n              \"leftValue\": \"={{ $json.body.object_attributes.source_branch }}\",\n              \"rightValue\": \"task/\",\n              \"operator\": {\n                \"type\": \"string\",\n                \"operation\": \"startsWith\"\n              }\n            }\n          ],\n          \"combinator\": \"and\"\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"5151b54a-8ec8-480e-b605-8dabe194f962\",\n      \"name\": \"→ F-05 Task MR Merged\",\n      \"type\": \"n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest\",\n      \"typeVersion\": 4.2,\n      \"position\": [\n        1340,\n        360\n      ],\n      \"parameters\": {\n        \"method\": \"POST\",\n        \"url\": \"={{ $env.N8N_WEBHOOK_BASE }}/gitlab-task-mr-merged\",\n        \"sendBody\": true,\n        \"contentType\": \"json\",\n        \"specifyBody\": \"json\",\n        \"jsonBody\": \"={{ $json.body }}\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"b00mr0002-0000-0000-0000-000000000002\",\n      \"name\": \"Merge: us/ prefix?\",\n      \"type\": \"n8n-nodes-base.if\",\n      \"typeVersion\": 2,\n      \"position\": [\n        1340,\n        480\n      ],\n      \"parameters\": {\n        \"conditions\": {\n          \"conditions\": [\n            {\n              \"leftValue\": \"={{ $json.body.object_attributes.source_branch }}\",\n              \"rightValue\": \"story/\",\n              \"operator\": {\n                \"type\": \"string\",\n                \"operation\": \"startsWith\"\n              }\n            }\n          ],\n          \"combinator\": \"and\"\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"4610489a-5bd5-4d0c-a1bd-11e6440d2e22\",\n      \"name\": \"→ F-08 Story MR Merged\",\n      \"type\": \"n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest\",\n      \"typeVersion\": 4.2,\n      \"position\": [\n        1560,\n        440\n      ],\n      \"parameters\": {\n        \"method\": \"POST\",\n        \"url\": \"={{ $env.N8N_WEBHOOK_BASE }}/gitlab-story-mr-merged\",\n        \"sendBody\": true,\n        \"contentType\": \"json\",\n        \"specifyBody\": \"json\",\n        \"jsonBody\": \"={{ $json.body }}\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"b00mr0002-0000-0000-0000-000000000003\",\n      \"name\": \"Merge: bugfix/ prefix?\",\n      \"type\": \"n8n-nodes-base.if\",\n      \"typeVersion\": 2,\n      \"position\": [\n        1560,\n        560\n      ],\n      \"parameters\": {\n        \"conditions\": {\n          \"conditions\": [\n            {\n              \"leftValue\": \"={{ $json.body.object_attributes.source_branch }}\",\n              \"rightValue\": \"bugfix/\",\n              \"operator\": {\n                \"type\": \"string\",\n                \"operation\": \"startsWith\"\n              }\n            }\n          ],\n          \"combinator\": \"and\"\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"12ea3777-57b4-49f8-b954-fc5bef46c8e1\",\n      \"name\": \"→ F-23 Revert Merged\",\n      \"type\": \"n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest\",\n      \"typeVersion\": 4.2,\n      \"position\": [\n        1780,\n        520\n      ],\n      \"parameters\": {\n        \"method\": \"POST\",\n        \"url\": \"={{ $env.N8N_WEBHOOK_BASE }}/gitlab-revert-merged\",\n        \"sendBody\": true,\n        \"contentType\": \"json\",\n        \"specifyBody\": \"json\",\n        \"jsonBody\": \"={{ $json.body }}\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"b00mr0002-0000-0000-0000-000000000004\",\n      \"name\": \"Merge: promote/ prefix?\",\n      \"type\": \"n8n-nodes-base.if\",\n      \"typeVersion\": 2,\n      \"position\": [\n        1780,\n        640\n      ],\n      \"parameters\": {\n        \"conditions\": {\n          \"conditions\": [\n            {\n              \"leftValue\": \"={{ $json.body.object_attributes.source_branch }}\",\n              \"rightValue\": \"promote/\",\n              \"operator\": {\n                \"type\": \"string\",\n                \"operation\": \"startsWith\"\n              }\n            }\n          ],\n          \"combinator\": \"and\"\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"50002362-72ec-45a0-899f-e1ab704f9954\",\n      \"name\": \"→ F-18 Release MR Merged\",\n      \"type\": \"n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest\",\n      \"typeVersion\": 4.2,\n      \"position\": [\n        2000,\n        600\n      ],\n      \"parameters\": {\n        \"method\": \"POST\",\n        \"url\": \"={{ $env.N8N_WEBHOOK_BASE }}/gitlab-release-mr-merged\",\n        \"sendBody\": true,\n        \"contentType\": \"json\",\n        \"specifyBody\": \"json\",\n        \"jsonBody\": \"={{ $json.body }}\"\n      }\n    }\n  ],\n  \"connections\": {\n    \"GitLab Webhook\": {\n      \"main\": [\n        [\n          {\n            \"node\": \"Verify Token\",\n            \"type\": \"main\",\n            \"index\": 0\n          }\n        ]\n      ]\n    },\n    \"Verify Token\": {\n      \"main\": [\n        [\n          {\n            \"node\": \"Is merge_request?\",\n            \"type\": \"main\",\n            \"index\": 0\n          }\n        ],\n        []\n      ]\n    },\n    \"Is merge_request?\": {\n      \"main\": [\n        [\n          {\n            \"node\": \"MR action = open?\",\n            \"type\": \"main\",\n            \"index\": 0\n          }\n        ],\n        [\n          {\n            \"node\": \"→ F-09 CI Pipeline\",\n            \"type\": \"main\",\n            \"index\": 0\n          }\n        ]\n      ]\n    },\n    \"MR action = open?\": {\n      \"main\": [\n        [\n          {\n            \"node\": \"Open: task/ prefix?\",\n            \"type\": \"main\",\n            \"index\": 0\n          }\n        ],\n        [\n          {\n            \"node\": \"Merge: task/ prefix?\",\n            \"type\": \"main\",\n            \"index\": 0\n          }\n        ]\n      ]\n    },\n    \"Open: task/ prefix?\": {\n      \"main\": [\n        [\n          {\n            \"node\": \"→ F-04 Task MR Opened\",\n            \"type\": \"main\",\n            \"index\": 0\n          }\n        ],\n        [\n          {\n            \"node\": \"Open: us/ prefix?\",\n            \"type\": \"main\",\n            \"index\": 0\n          }\n        ]\n      ]\n    },\n    \"Open: us/ prefix?\": {\n      \"main\": [\n        [\n          {\n            \"node\": \"→ F-07 Story MR Opened\",\n            \"type\": \"main\",\n            \"index\": 0\n          }\n        ],\n        []\n      ]\n    },\n    \"Merge: task/ prefix?\": {\n      \"main\": [\n        [\n          {\n            \"node\": \"→ F-05 Task MR Merged\",\n            \"type\": \"main\",\n            \"index\": 0\n          }\n        ],\n        [\n          {\n            \"node\": \"Merge: us/ prefix?\",\n            \"type\": \"main\",\n            \"index\": 0\n          }\n        ]\n      ]\n    },\n    \"Merge: us/ prefix?\": {\n      \"main\": [\n        [\n          {\n            \"node\": \"→ F-08 Story MR Merged\",\n            \"type\": \"main\",\n            \"index\": 0\n          }\n        ],\n        [\n          {\n            \"node\": \"Merge: bugfix/ prefix?\",\n            \"type\": \"main\",\n            \"index\": 0\n          }\n        ]\n      ]\n    },\n    \"Merge: bugfix/ prefix?\": {\n      \"main\": [\n        [\n          {\n            \"node\": \"→ F-23 Revert Merged\",\n            \"type\": \"main\",\n            \"index\": 0\n          }\n        ],\n        [\n          {\n            \"node\": \"Merge: promote/ prefix?\",\n            \"type\": \"main\",\n            \"index\": 0\n          }\n        ]\n      ]\n    },\n    \"Merge: promote/ prefix?\": {\n      \"main\": [\n        [\n          {\n            \"node\": \"→ F-18 Release MR Merged\",\n            \"type\": \"main\",\n            \"index\": 0\n          }\n        ],\n        []\n      ]\n    }\n  },\n  \"active\": true,\n  \"tags\": [],\n  \"settings\": {\n    \"executionOrder\": \"v1\"\n  }\n}\n","F-01-plan-release.json":"{\r\n  \"name\": \"F-01 /plan_release\",\r\n  \"nodes\": [\r\n    {\r\n      \"id\": \"640b5fba-4d3c-4c1e-9ca3-34b4278d83ad\",\r\n      \"name\": \"Webhook Trigger\",\r\n      \"type\": \"n8n-nodes-base.webhook\",\r\n      \"typeVersion\": 2,\r\n      \"position\": [\r\n        240,\r\n        300\r\n      ],\r\n      \"parameters\": {\r\n        \"path\": \"plan-release\",\r\n        \"httpMethod\": \"POST\",\r\n        \"responseMode\": \"onReceived\",\r\n        \"responseData\": \"allEntries\"\r\n      },\r\n      \"webhookId\": \"aa24848e-da89-4e4d-b81c-6b167ad2b6d2\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"id\": \"3e881a0f-4cee-4076-806c-97c39841b19f\",\r\n      \"name\": \"Notify: Starting plan_release\",\r\n      \"type\": \"n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest\",\r\n      \"typeVersion\": 4.2,\r\n      \"position\": [\r\n        680,\r\n        300\r\n      ],\r\n      \"parameters\": {\r\n        \"method\": \"POST\",\r\n        \"url\": \"={{ $env.OPENWEBUI_CALLBACK_URL }}\",\r\n        \"sendHeaders\": true,\r\n        \"headerParameters\": {\r\n          \"parameters\": [\r\n            {\r\n              \"name\": \"Content-Type\",\r\n              \"value\": \"application/json\"\r\n            }\r\n          ]\r\n        },\r\n        \"sendBody\": true,\r\n        \"bodyParameters\": {\r\n          \"parameters\": [\r\n            {\r\n              \"name\": \"flow_id\",\r\n              \"value\": \"={{ $json.body?.flow_id ?? $json.flow_id ?? '' }}\"\r\n            },\r\n            {\r\n              \"name\": \"message\",\r\n              \"value\": \"🔍 plan_release started — Arch+DE gate A running\"\r\n            },\r\n            {\r\n              \"name\": \"notes\",\r\n              \"value\": \"\"\r\n            }\r\n          ]\r\n        }\r\n      }\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"id\": \"b1000001-0000-0000-0000-000000000001\",\r\n      \"name\": \"Architect Input\",\r\n      \"type\": \"n8n-nodes-base.set\",\r\n      \"typeVersion\": 3.4,\r\n      \"position\": [\r\n        900,\r\n        200\r\n      ],\r\n      \"parameters\": {\r\n        \"mode\": \"manual\",\r\n        \"assignments\": {\r\n          \"assignments\": [\r\n            {\r\n              \"id\": \"1\",\r\n              \"name\": \"role\",\r\n              \"value\": \"architect\",\r\n              \"type\": \"string\"\r\n            },\r\n            {\r\n              \"id\": \"1b\",\r\n              \"name\": \"skipWikiVerify\",\r\n              \"value\": true,\r\n              \"type\": \"boolean\"\r\n            },\r\n            {\r\n              \"id\": \"2\",\r\n              \"name\": \"prompt\",\r\n              \"value\": \"=Requirements discussion (from chat, before this command was run): {{ $node['Webhook Trigger'].json.body.body.context ?? 'none — no prior discussion' }}\\n\\nStack instruction: {{ $node['Webhook Trigger'].json.body.body.stack ?? 'not specified — choose per Design Principles (boring technology)' }}. If a stack is given, use it exactly for this analysis, do not substitute a different one. If it's malformed or unrecognizable as a stack, flag it and fall back to choosing per Design Principles instead of guessing what was meant. This is a PLANNING report only — do NOT touch GitLab at all (no repo checks, no commits, no wiki pages, no scaffolding); kickoff is what actually scaffolds the workspace on this stack once the plan is approved. Analyse release scope for {{ $node['Webhook Trigger'].json.body.body.version }}. Output: components affected, risk surface, API contract changes, and an estimated compute cost table — one row per new or changed service (columns: vCPU request×replicas, memory request×replicas, est. $/day, notes), steady-state running cost only (not one-off build/CI cost), using ~$0.04/vCPU-hour and ~$0.005/GB-RAM-hour baseline cloud on-demand rates adjusted for known-pricier categories (managed Kafka/DB, GPU) — note the adjustment when used, plus a release-total $/day row at the bottom. Describe the overall backend architecture using two diagrams: (1) a system-level flowchart (`flowchart TD` or `graph TD`) showing the affected components/services and their static relationships, and (2) a sequence diagram (`sequenceDiagram`) showing the runtime request/data flow through those components for the release's main use case. For EACH diagram: write its Mermaid source to a local `.mmd` file, then run `render-mermaid.sh \u003cname\u003e.svg \u003cname\u003e.mmd` (a ready-made script — it wakes the mermaid-render microservice, renders a true vector SVG (no resolution ceiling, unlike a fixed-pixel PNG — diagram text stays legible at any zoom/print scale), scales the service back down itself; just call it and check it printed the output path, don't reimplement any of this) and `mc cp` the resulting SVG alongside the markdown: `mc cp \u003cname\u003e.svg local/release-reports/{{ $node['Webhook Trigger'].json.body.body.version }}/\u003cname\u003e.svg`. Write the overall analysis to a local markdown file referencing both SVGs via standard `![\u003ctitle\u003e](\u003cname\u003e.svg)` image syntax — NOT a ```mermaid fenced code block, the final PDF renderer can only show an embedded image, not Mermaid source — then upload it to MinIO (this is the plan_release \u003c-\u003e kickoff hand-off store, not a GitLab wiki): `mc alias set local $MINIO_ENDPOINT $MINIO_ROOT_USER $MINIO_ROOT_PASSWORD \u003e/dev/null \u0026\u0026 mc cp \u003cyour-file\u003e.md local/release-reports/{{ $node['Webhook Trigger'].json.body.body.version }}/architecture.md`. Then, for EVERY new service (not existing/changed-only services) identified above, write a SEPARATE local markdown file containing only that service's own sequence diagram for its primary flow, its own flowchart for its main decision/process logic, an ERD (`erDiagram`) if it owns persistence (omit and say so if it doesn't) — each rendered to its own SVG via `render-mermaid.sh` the same way and referenced via `![](...)` image syntax, never a raw ```mermaid fence — and an API doc table (columns Method, Path, Request, Response, Auth) listing every endpoint it exposes — one markdown file per service, never combined — and upload each (markdown AND its SVGs) as its own object(s): `mc cp \u003cservice-file\u003e.md local/release-reports/{{ $node['Webhook Trigger'].json.body.body.version }}/architecture-\u003cservice-slug\u003e.md` (service-slug = the service name, lowercased, spaces to hyphens), SVGs alongside it the same way. Report the exact object path of the overall file, every per-service file, and every SVG once all uploads succeed.\",\r\n              \"type\": \"string\"\r\n            },\r\n            {\r\n              \"id\": \"3\",\r\n              \"name\": \"story\",\r\n              \"value\": \"={{ $node['Webhook Trigger'].json.body.body.version }}\",\r\n              \"type\": \"string\"\r\n            }\r\n          ]\r\n        }\r\n      }\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"id\": \"3a736ffc-34c4-4ee2-acc7-b4c34d0dc4fc\",\r\n      \"name\": \"Architect Analysis\",\r\n      \"type\": \"n8n-nodes-base.executeWorkflow\",\r\n      \"typeVersion\": 1.1,\r\n      \"position\": [\r\n     